---
layout: layouts/base.njk
schemaArticle: true
---
<article class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="post-meta"><a href="/blog/">&larr; All posts</a></p>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ page.date | isoDate }}">{{ page.date | readableDate }}</time> · By <a href="/author/" rel="author">{{ site.authorPenName }}</a></p>
    {% if ogImage %}<img class="post-hero-image" src="{{ ogImage }}" alt="" width="1200" height="630">{% endif %}
    {{ content | safe }}
    <hr>
    <aside class="editorial-note">
      <h2>About our guidance</h2>
      <p>Made Out of Clay shares general reading and family ideas, not medical advice. Children differ; use your judgment and ask a qualified health professional about individual sensory, developmental, or safety concerns.</p>
    </aside>
    <aside class="article-next-step">
      <h2>Keep reading together</h2>
      {% if tag == 'Neurodivergent Kids' or tag == 'Big Feelings' %}
      <p>Explore identity-first and gentle stories in <a href="/series/just-the-way-you-are/">Just the Way You Are</a>, then pair one with a <a href="https://club.madeoutofclayprod.com/printables">free printable</a>.</p>
      {% elif tag == 'Faith & Family' or tag == 'Faith and Family' %}
      <p>Meet <a href="/series/titus-the-lamb/">Titus the Lamb</a> for an explicitly Christian picture-book preview and sing-along.</p>
      {% else %}
      <p><a href="/books/#find-by-need">Find a print book by theme</a> or <a href="https://club.madeoutofclayprod.com/">open a free digital story</a>.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </aside>

    <aside class="related-posts">
      <h2>More from the Journal</h2>
      <ul>
        {% for related in collections.posts %}{% if related.url != page.url and loop.index <= 4 %}<li><a href="{{ related.url }}">{{ related.data.title }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <section class="article-signup">
      <h2>New stories and free printables</h2>
      <p>Join the parent and caregiver list for new releases, practical reading ideas, and printable activities.</p>
      {% set signupLocation = "article" %}
      {% include "partials/newsletter.njk" %}
    </section>
  </div>
</article>
